 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Dominated by the root-finding step for critical points (Newton-Raphson iterations per cell) and the eigenvalue decomposition of the Jacobian at each zero. Tracing separatrices adds cost proportional to the number of separatrices and integration steps.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Linear with respect to the number of grid cells for storing the field and critical points.
